# parchment: a LIGHT warm theme. Background lightness is a stronger at-a-glance
# signal than hue -- a pale bar is unmistakable in a strip of dark ones -- and
# glacier was the only light theme in the set. Kept clearly tinted, not
# near-white, so the constant white current-session chip still reads on it.
# All six keys, because the derived dim-grey border is wrong on a light bar.
bar     bg=#e0d2b4 fg=#3a2e1c
window  fg=#f8f2e4 bg=#856633 bold
accent  fg=#a07430
border  fg=#b2a184
select  fg=#f8f2e4 bg=#826834
prompt  bg=#ece0c8 fg=#3a2e1c
